cc-3dm (lib/3dm) - CadCraft's own reader for .3dm files. Apache-2.0, Copyright DDG / the CadCraft authors.

The chunk layout, typecodes and the records inside them (object attributes, layers, materials, block definitions, meshes,
curves, surfaces, polysurfaces, extrusions) follow the openNURBS toolkit's file-format sources (opennurbs_archive.cpp,
opennurbs_3dm.h and the Read() functions of the classes named in objects.js), read as a reference after a licence check
(docs/0.7-sessions/usd.md, docs/0.7-sessions/3dm.md). The code here is our own JavaScript. The toolkit carries this notice:

