The B-spline evaluation (geom.js) and the Delaunay insertion (cdt.js) are written from the textbooks (Piegl & Tiller, "The
NURBS Book"; de Berg et al., "Computational Geometry"). zlib.js is a byte-identical copy of lib/exr/zlib.js (written from
RFC 1950 / RFC 1951). earcut.js is a copy of ModelCraft's earcut.js, written after mapbox/earcut: ISC License, Copyright (c)
2016, Mapbox (its notice is in the file).
